CharacterName":"鈴原 孝志","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He lived his life with a dull personality and a dull appearance. He quit his job and came back to the countryside to rely on his parents. Turns out, his parents left the country to spend the rest of their lives in the tropics."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't have a girlfriend, and all his friends have left the countryside, and he rarely see them. When he watch dramas and cartoons in which people are living a glorious adolescence, he thinks to himself “I wish I could have lived such a youth!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He spends his days in front of the TV gritting his teeth. He grumbles about his dull and boring life without even trying to change it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But then he met a god of eroticism who made his body smaller and made him more popular. His hobby is to go out to the city once a month and play UFO catcher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c132934"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c32522","characterName":"藤崎 朱鳥","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c32522"},"originalCharacterName":"藤崎 朱鳥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"138"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"34"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A virgin. Born and raised in the countryside, she has a slight yearning for the city. She is a big sister-type loli girl who takes good care of her younger siblings. She good at studying but bad at sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her favorite thing is collecting stuffed toys. She loves creepy-cute stuffed animals. Of course, she also likes cute stuffed toys. She also likes to play make-believe and doctor with stuffed animals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is good friends with Rui! They have been playing together for as long as they can remember. She admires Rui's energy and imagination."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a habit of masturbating in the school bathroom (she doesn't think it's masturbation). She is curious about Takashi because he is the first boy to be in her class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32522"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80ddd3c68db0131a75a775f8fc072e753b40cfb6013e890aac2aadc42abbaace.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c864aa594ea8c6115bf743c424d561382ba23189c2d737bb98726713c5e170d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤邑 鈴香","creatorId":"vndb:s2309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2309","name":"藤邑鈴香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:52418","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c32523","characterName":"美山 瑠衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c32523"},"originalCharacterName":"美山 瑠衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"138"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Virgin. Born and raised in the countryside. She is more of a younger sister type of girl. She is energetic and boyish. She loves nature and physical activity, so she is not interested in the city."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves red, and prefers to wear red clothes and accessories. It gives her energy and makes her hotblooded. She becomes awkward when treated like a girl, she becomes shy and docile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is good at health and physical education and is interested in the male body. She is happy to have a boy in her class for the first time so she can play with him seriously."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32523"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/1081090431992d548714d00620294ebd48f19ce5c4039fd547fb62983ffbcefa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7ce2e8625fc13bd9e9ecf4762e637e29e2ff07e2bc4fb650bef117862399a61d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋 きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:52417","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41822","characterName":"エロ神","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41822"},"originalCharacterName":"エロ神","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A female erotic goddess enshrined in an abandoned neighborhood shrine. She likes young girls naked. She likes to see them in a naughty way or having sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the past, students used to hide behind the shrine where she was enshrined and have sex. Thanks to the depopulation of the village and its demise, She doesn't